110
00:10:40,719 --> 00:10:43,861
The building needs to sort of, you need to remove the triangle.

111
00:10:44,825 --> 00:10:52,690
And even in small town where I have a house on there, you can not have like a bush in the corner.

112
00:10:52,710 --> 00:10:59,735
